e you i love the  fact that he just calls him whitebeard's  old apprentice like he's a kid at a  grown-up table the pirate king's right  hand man showing up also freaks out kobe  as well his eyes pop out as if luffy was  using his toon powers on him  interestingly enough the dark king  decides to enforce a compromise where  the people turn to stone are released  and he will ensure that this  de-escalates without issue we later find  out why he may have been so kind to  blackbeard here he adds then the  invaders will leave the island and he  won't allow any funny business we jump  back to present day former empress of  amazon lily shukuyaku is here and yes  it's revealed that she is the ex-captain  of the cuja pirates rayleigh is thanked  for saving the day and this is big what  he says right now he says to be frank we  got lucky circumstances allowed me to  resolve things with my reputation i've  gotten old i'm pretty certain i wouldn't  win a head-on fight against blackbeard  these days now yes rayleigh is not in  his prime but it's still huge praise for  blackbeard and chances are he let  blackbeard have his crew back because if  he didn't he knew blackbeard would be  more likely to fight and then raylee  would probably lose if you ever needed a  sign that we are in the new era it's  when the dark king says blackbeard would  beat him compared to how blackbeard  handled whitebeard pre-timeskip needing  his crew to help him with an old injured  and sick whitebeard this is huge news  coming from another old era legend it's  clear that like luffy blackbeard got a  lot stronger during the time skip the  pacifists are then brought up and it's  noted that they had no scratches on them  after everything that happened and that  one of them looked like boa when she was  a kid so not only is the lunarian stuff  being used they're also using boa's  beauty to their advantage and like i  mentioned there was one that launched an  attack reminiscent to mihawks slash so  it seems like they're using old warlord  powers and putting them into these  pacifistas but i never really get that  excited about pacifistas because i feel  like they can't compare to strong human  characters and never will but here oda  is definitely spending a significant  amount of focus and time on hyping them  up clearly the marines made these guys  to be at least warlord level to replace  the old warlord system and yes warlord  level doesn't mean much because it  varies a lot depending on the warlord  but you get what i mean mihawk still  better be able to wreck them all the  same that's all i'm saying then finally  we find out that blackbeard didn't  actually leave empty-handed captain kobe  the hero of the rocky port incident has  been abducted by one of the four  emperors blackbeard his current status  is unknown we're told word spreads  across the world and you know the straw  hats will find out about this soon as  well this is what makes blackbeard such  an interesting villain even when he  loses he wins it looked like he had to  walk away empty-handed but he turned it  around and got another huge bargaining  chip to work with and all i'm thinking  is wow blackbeard is doing a great job  of making luffy hate him obviously he's  the blame for the ace stuff and there  was already a lot of reasons for luffy  to dislike him but blackbeard just keeps  giving him more reasons like just  imagine when luffy hears how he handled  boa and then how he kidnapped kobe this  rivalry is heating up big time right now  and i would be very surprised if  blackbeard doesn't play a bigger part in  this arc but channel the pirate king  within and smash that like button if you  enjoyed this video and want to keep the  reviews coming always be a smashing  powder king rather than passing orochi  and youtube will reward you by sending  fireworks from wano straight to your  screen give it a shot it actually works  i gotta say i love this chapter let me  know your thoughts on everything  including blackbeard's playing with kobe  his new bounty his new power and so on  i'm so excited and while you wait for  next chapter to drop feel free to check  out my huge and growing one-piece  playlist that includes all mythical zone  users all admirals a one hour video on  shanks and much more link to that is in  the description and on screen right now  and until next time see you space  cowboys
 

